(6301: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: One%20explicit%20historical%20descriptor%20view%20for%20the%20relative-array%20generator%20only.%20The%20complete%20original%20frontend%20retains%20its%20independently%20certified897bfc%20source%20context%3B%20the%20distinct%20current%20frontend%20is%20authenticated%20through%20the%20existing%20checked%20raw-source%20descriptor%20receipt.%20A%20second%20complete%20certified7881%20inference%20source%20has%20one%20finite%20nullable-array%20owner%20insertion%20whose%20inverse%20is%20used%20only%20in%20this%20same%20descriptor%20scope.%20The%20actual%20current%20inference%20fix%20remains%20independently%20exercised%3B%20no%20source%20behavior%20equivalence%20is%20inferred.%20Every%20original%20relative-array%20descriptor%2C%20receipt%2C%20native%20definition%2C24-source%20inventory%2C%20fixture%20and%20two-change%20assertion%20stays%20exact.%20Actual%20current%20parsing%2C%20emission%2C%20source%20descriptors%20and%20native%20CI%20remain%20independent.) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
